e area is supplied with bounds/bbox, building is selected with overture_type=building, and optional release, dataset and column parameters can limit the query.","source_id":"overture_fused_data_mirror_docs","source_url":"https://docs.overturemaps.org/getting-data/data-mirrors/fused/","supports_fields":["source_cooperative_hosting","bbox_or_bounds","overture_type_building","optional_release","optional_dataset","optional_columns"]},{"accessed_at":"2026-08-02T20:16:00Z","content_sha256":"4a2d84fa9656a89a295cf59d29e02b7d9e9529fba52fdbf654fe53eed6b489bc","hash_scope":"normalized_source_excerpt_utf8","license_or_terms_url":"https://www.fused.io/terms","publisher":"Fused, Inc.","record_scope":"Current Fused SDK loading, bbox ordering and execution-bound contract.","relevant_record_ids_or_excerpt":"Fused documents public UDFs as free through fused.load(\"UDF_Name\"), recommends pinning Git commit URLs for production, and accepts bounds as a four-number list ordered [min_x,min_y,max_x,max_y]. The default remote realtime engine has an approximately 120 second time limit.","source_id":"fused_running_udfs_docs","source_url":"https://docs.fused.io/guide/working-with-udfs/fused-run/","supports_fields":["public_udf_free","fused_load","pinned_git_commit","bbox_order","remote_time_limit_120s"]},{"accessed_at":"2026-08-02T20:16:00Z","content_sha256":"adbb96a14916b6a0744dd386a20dc920ceed7564f6b1c2360ef6e961a5f1c91b","hash_scope":"normalized_source_excerpt_utf8","license_or_terms_url":"https://www.fused.io/terms","publisher":"Fused, Inc.","record_scope":"Current HTTP sharing/token requirement and output endpoint form.","relevant_record_ids_or_excerpt":"Fused HTTP API endpoints require a shared canvas token in the form fc_<token> and a UDF name, for example udf.ai/fc_<CANVAS_TOKEN>/my_udf.json. Without a shared canvas token, a deterministic anonymous HTTP endpoint for this UDF is not established.","source_id":"fused_udfs_as_api_docs","source_url":"https://docs.fused.io/guide/working-with-udfs/run-udfs-as-api/","supports_fields":["canvas_token_required","fc_token","udf_ai_endpoint","anonymous_http_endpoint_not_established_without_token"]},{"accessed_at":"2026-08-02T20:16:00Z","content_sha256":"94e584cc302bf7424216ba425e208801be2d7629c4e0493ee25ccf778d37c593","hash_scope":"normalized_source_excerpt_utf8","license_or_terms_url":"https://github.com/fusedio/udfs/blob/cc9e3f919d2a978aa917c2845326e359ad72011b/LICENSE","publisher":"Fused, Inc.","record_scope":"Pinned open-source implementation contract and Source Cooperative path construction.","relevant_record_ids_or_excerpt":"Pinned Fused UDF source defines bounds, release, theme, overture_type and use_columns. For building it maps theme to buildings, defaults to six parts for releases from 2025-01-22-0, constructs s3://us-west-2.opendata.source.coop/fused/overture/{release}/theme={theme}/type={overture_type}, and calls table_to_tile(bounds,...). The pinned source default release is 2026-04-15-0, not the current official release.","source_blob_sha":"e684af6acc6b7c39c5f113365e5e32a21ba26839","source_id":"fused_overture_udf_pinned_source","source_url":"https://github.com/fusedio/udfs/blob/cc9e3f919d2a978aa917c2845326e359ad72011b/public/Overture_Maps_Example/Overture_Maps_Example.py","supports_fields":["bounds","release","theme","overture_type","use_columns","building_parts_6","source_cooperative_s3_path","table_to_tile","default_release_2026_04_15_0"]},{"accessed_at":"2026-08-02T20:16:00Z","content_sha256":"1b44cab17c6483b2d05b5267a5f84e6bde4fc64d21fa4d7a7289dc8d4750c53d","hash_scope":"normalized_source_excerpt_utf8","license_or_terms_url":"https://github.com/fusedio/udfs/blob/cc9e3f919d2a978aa917c2845326e359ad72011b/LICENSE","publisher":"Fused Labs, Inc.","record_scope":"Open-source code license for the pinned UDF implementation.","relevant_record_ids_or_excerpt":"The fusedio/udfs repository is licensed under the MIT License and permits use, copying, modification, distribution, sublicensing and sale subj